Description: Animated terminal effect screensaver for Linux desktops
 ASCII Saver renders custom artwork with randomized terminal text effects
 when the desktop session becomes idle. It supports multiple monitors,
 includes native idle integration for KDE Plasma and GNOME sessions,
 dismisses the overlay on lock, and includes a libadwaita control panel for
 artwork, playlists, palettes, previews and diagnostics.
 .
 The package ships prebuilt native idle watchers and the instrumented ttfx
 renderer, so no Python virtual environment or Rust toolchain is needed on the
 installed system.
